        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s3_1",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "I need to get to work in the city by 9:00 so I'll drop her off at 8:30. You're pretty close to the city here so that should give me plenty of time to get there.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_2",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "That's fine. Now, we also need to decide which group she'll be in. we have two different groups and they're divided up according to age. There's the green group. Which is for three- to four-year-olds. And then there's the red group which is for four- to five-year-olds.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_3",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "She's quite mature for her age and she can already write her name and read a little.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_4",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Well, I'll put her in the red group and we can always change her to the green one if there are any problems.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_5",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "That sounds fine.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_6",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "OK. Let's move on to meals. We can provide breakfast, lunch and dinner. As she's finishing pretty early, she won't need dinner, will you give her breakfast before she comes?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_7",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "Yes, she'll only need lunch.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_8",
            "speaker": "SPEAKER",
            "text": "-------",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_9",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Now, does she have any medical conditions we need to know about? Does she have asthma or any hearing problems for example?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_10",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "No. But she does need to wear glasses.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s3_11",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Oh, I'll make a note of that.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
