        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s4_1",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "Yes, she's pretty good about wearing them, she can't see much without them.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_2",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Right. OK. Now, I also need emergency contact details.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_3",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "So what sort of information do you need?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_4",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Just the name and number of a friend or family member we can contact in case we can't get hold of you at any time.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_5",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "OK. That'd better be my sister … Jenny Ball. That's B-A-double L. Her phone number is 3346 7523.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_6",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Great. So she is the child's aunt?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_7",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "Yes, that's right.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_8",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "I'll make a note of that as well. Now, is there anything you'd like to ask?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_9",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "What about payment? How much are the fees each term?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_10",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Well, for two days and the hours you've chosen, that will be $450 altogether.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_11",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "OK, and do I have to pay that now?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_12",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "No, we send out invoices once the children start at the centre. You can choose to pay at the end of each term or we do offer a slightly discounted rate if you pay every month.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_13",
            "speaker": "CAROL",
            "text": "Oh, I'll do that then. I find it easier to budget that way and I'm not used to the term dates just yet.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_14",
            "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
            "text": "Good, it makes it a lot simpler for us as well. Well, that's everything. Would you like me to show you around …?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
